> limit x*sin(1/x) x->0
limit of x*sin(1/x) as x -> 0:
  1/x -> inf (the numerator -> 1, x -> 0+)
  1/x -> inf: sin(1/x) keeps oscillating between -1 and 1
  squeeze: x -> 0 times a bounded factor
  = 0 (from both sides)
